Locally maintained OpenShift GitOps 1.22.2 chart packaging (GCP-1280)

The CustomResourceDefinitions (gitops-operator-crds) and the operator RBAC
rules, Deployment shape, environment and image references (gitops-operator)
are taken from the official OpenShift GitOps operator bundle
registry.redhat.io/openshift-gitops-1/gitops-operator-bundle@sha256:2ba58c50f771c08bbc5a1d8572c7b058df55bc71667cc66026d42840eb4bee6d
(appVersion 1.22.2), which declares its upstream source as
https://github.com/redhat-developer/gitops-operator.git at commit
cf32771491be2ed7f03d43d279171d6c265f2d2b. That repository is licensed under
the Apache License 2.0; the LICENSE file shipped in this chart is a verbatim
copy of that commit's LICENSE (sha256
43070e2d4e532684de521b885f385d0841030efa2b1a20bafb76133a5e1379c1).
Licenses of individual upstream dependencies that the CRDs originate from were
not separately verified.

CHANGES MADE TO UPSTREAM FILES (Apache License 2.0, section 4(b)):

  * crds/argocds.argoproj.io.yaml (gitops-operator-crds) is a MODIFIED copy of
    the bundle file manifests/argoproj.io_argocds.yaml (sha256
    7b812b76b4e89b58df34cb34a47e4d97bc91ea13a1c7340148905a44a71843ef): the
    v1alpha1 entry of spec.versions and the whole spec.conversion block (the
    Webhook conversion) were REMOVED. The v1beta1 version entry is unchanged.
    The file was re-serialized by yq, so its bytes differ from the original.
  * The other seven CRD files in gitops-operator-crds are unmodified copies of
    the corresponding bundle files.
  * gitops-operator/templates/rbac.yaml and gitops-operator/values.yaml are
    GENERATED from the bundle's ClusterServiceVersion (rules, environment and
    image references); the default of ENABLE_CONVERSION_WEBHOOK was changed from
    "true" to "false" and WATCH_NAMESPACE was added as an empty value.

The Helm scaffolding (Chart.yaml, other templates, packaging) was written
independently for this repository. This is a local packaging for GKE bootstrap
use: it is not a Red Hat-published, supported, or certified chart. See
chart-src/PROVENANCE.md in the gcp-hcp repository.
